# TASK/KEYOWNER, EmuDESK (in-kernel desktop, no #Z), card = tools/make-sd-image.sh
# 64 MiB (C:\ACC\SYSACC.NAC + C:\SYSACC2.NAC), no C:\CMDLINE.TXT (so "Next start"
# shows the defaults; Serial console = Off). Open the System Info dialog from
# the Desk menu (26,9) -> first " System Info" (60,66), as desk-si.actions.
# Then the "Serial console" drop-down (486,383; coordinates from
# measurement-2026-10-08-sysinfo2/screendumps/diag-X02_POPUP.png) three times,
# keys only inside the drop-down (the accessory holds wind_update(BEG_MCTRL)):
#   1. open -> Esc                    : closed, Next start still "Off"
#   2. open -> Up -> Return           : "On" highlighted, then chosen
#   3. open -> Down -> Esc            : "Off" highlighted, then cancelled ("On" kept)
# then Cancel (468,455) closes the dialog without saving.
# HEAD (before KEYOWNER): the keys go to EmuDESK's own evnt_multi, the box stays
# open (measurement-2026-10-08-sysinfo2, RUNINFO "Esc").
# Every mark >= 200 ticks before the next input (drive-m3.py dumps 0.5 s after
# the mark line). Ticks hz_200 after "[desk] desktop up" (desk-arm-m3.py).
# IKBD make codes: Esc 01, Return 1C, Up 48, Down 50; break = make | 0x80.
100 parkbr
400 mark K00_IDLE
500 move 26 9
1000 move 60 66
1200 down
1203 up
2200 mark K01_DIALOG
2400 move 486 383
2500 down
2503 up
2800 mark K02_POPUP1
3100 key 01
3106 key 81
3400 mark K03_ESC_CLOSED
3700 down
3703 up
4000 mark K04_POPUP2
4300 key 48
4306 key C8
4600 mark K05_UP_ON
4900 key 1C
4906 key 9C
5200 mark K06_RETURN_ON
5500 down
5503 up
5800 mark K07_POPUP3
6100 key 50
6106 key D0
6400 mark K08_DOWN_OFF
6700 key 01
6706 key 81
7000 mark K09_ESC_KEPT_ON
7200 move 468 455
7300 down
7303 up
7700 mark K10_CANCELLED
7800 parkbr
8100 mark END
